 "source_instruction": "i am looking for a  electric pink zebra mules & clogs of ethylene vinyl.",
 "query": "I spent my whole lunch break today sitting on the curb outside my job site watching the feral cat colony that\u2019s set up camp behind the construction supply shed, and man, those little guys have got the whole place figured out. The calico that\u2019s clearly the boss of the group dragged a whole half of a discarded breakfast burrito over to the tiniest kitten first before any of the other cats could crowd in, and I swear she stared right at me like she was making sure I wasn\u2019t gonna sneak a bite for myself. I even dug the extra pack of tuna treats I keep in my work bag for them out, and by the time I had to head back in, three of the bolder ones were rubbing against my work boots like we were old friends. I was browsing the men's mules & clogs section earlier and need to find a pair that has propylene vinyl material, comes in the electric pink zebra option, and I\u2019m sticking to that usual price cap I always use, y\u2019know? Oh, and make sure whichever pair I pick has that reinforced steel toe cap for job site safety, I don\u2019t want to skip that detail. I don\u2019t need anything too fancy otherwise, just something that fits those marks without going over what I\u2019m comfortable spending. Let me know what options you have that match all that!",
